      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file that flags or redacts unsafe spans from text using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a specific service that provides text analysis or content moderation. One suitable service is the Amazon Comprehend service, which can detect unsafe content in text. I will write the Python code to use the Amazon Comprehend SDK to identify and redact unsafe content. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865683412,
