    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `moderate_batch.py` that moderates a batch of user messages and returns per-message decisions using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Comprehend service, which is a natural language processing (NLP) service offered by AWS. This service can be identified by the import of the `boto3` library and the use of the `comprehend` client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865678641,
          "start": 1789865676612
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc4ecf44001hg4UrC3xFCbYU1",
